    narr:narration """This position holds that [humidity sensors go into all four greenhouse bays before the first frost](narr:Expr_20261009_2_Batch1Greenhouse20261009050853_hf6ea0fc7e73d_1), with [bay two receiving the pilot unit first because it lost the most seedlings last winter](narr:Expr_20261009_2_Batch1Greenhouse20261009050853_hf6ea0fc7e73d_2) — a directive framed with loss-based rationale. [Pell Vasquez's agreement](narr:Expr_20261009_2_Batch1Greenhouse20261009050853_hf6ea0fc7e73d_3) ratifies the sequence without amendment. The schedule logic runs on a frost deadline, refined by prior-loss prioritization.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261009_2_Batch1Greenhouse20261009050853_hf6ea0fc7e73d_1> ;
